WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Open the terminal. Signed out, it trades paper dollars on live prices.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.300
Skip the tour. Five steps explain the line, UP and DOWN, the value pill, Trail and Close.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.300
Wait for the book. UP lights once someone is on the other side at this size.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.900
Tap UP. A paper call fills at the live book's price.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.900
Watch what it's worth. The pill shows what CLOSE pays now.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.100
Close it. CLOSE sells it back at what the book pays.
